1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The estimate is preliminary, not a promise.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Only three of the twelve samples passed; the other nine need another test.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The medicine may reduce the pain, but it cannot cure the disease.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Do not take a second dose unless a doctor tells you to.

5
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
MARA: I lent Deniz my car, not my sister's.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
DENIZ: Then I owe you an apology, not her.

7
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
If the valve does not open, stop the pump.

8
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
If it opens but the pressure does not fall, call the engineer.

9
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,000
The report did not say that the bridge was safe.

10
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
It said that there was not enough evidence to declare it unsafe.

11
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,000
The room was almost empty, except for two guards and a sleeping dog.

12
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
One guard was outside the door; the other was behind the desk.

13
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:33,000
I did not say she stole the money.

14
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
I said she might know who borrowed it.

15
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,000
The fare is fifteen euros per person, excluding luggage.

16
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Children under six travel free, but they still need a ticket.
